Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers can manipulate STP using rogue switches and malicious BPDUs.

Solution:
Use multiple STP security features together:
- PortFast
- BPDU Guard
- Root Guard
- Loop Guard

Benefit:
Comprehensive protection against STP-based attacks and topology manipulation.

Limitation:
Does not directly detect unidirectional link failures.

Next Practical:
UDLD (Unidirectional Link Detection)
